        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-27T19:59:05Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(app): convert standalone tools to component stacks in one step\n\nThe tool_convert plan proposes a stack for each standalone tool (its\nlibrary holder as the built-in holder component, a collet for the shank\nwhere the holder needs one, the tool as a solid cutting item) and judges\nit: same, different (with the differences) or no match (with the reason).\nConvertToComponents lands the selected rows in one undo step, and the MCP\ntool convert_tools_to_components has a dry run that returns the preview.\n\nRefs #4339\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
