      },
      "message": "feat(ui): preview and convert standalone tools in the tool library\n\n\"Convert to components…\" in the tool list header opens a preview: one\nrow for each standalone tool with its proposed stack and the result\n(same, different with each difference, no match with the reason). The\nsame rows start ticked; Convert selected is one undo step. A tool with\nthe old default stick-out (no shank in the holder) gets one shank\ndiameter more of shank, with the same gauge length, and shows as\ndifferent. The MCP reference and the guide name the new tool.\n\nRefs #4339\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
